    <subfield code="a">"A book of lithographs by Raymond Pettibon, Greg Colson, Francesca Gabbiani, Scott Grieger, Eddie Ruschá, and Dani Tull. Photograph by Todd Squires. Paintings on the aluminum cover by Victor Gastelum. Title on the cover silk screened by Jeff Wasserman of the Wasserman Silk Screen Company of Santa Monica. Book binding by Kitty Maryatt of the Two Hands Press of Woodland Hills, California. Printed and bound in an edition of 27"--Colophon.</subfield>
  </datafield>
